WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:13.514
went back to her friends.

2
00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:16.175
"I just remembered," she said.

3
00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:18.937
"It's, uh, my aunt's birthday.

4
00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:20.078
I should call her."

5
00:00:21.178 --> 00:00:22.159
Roxy hurried away.

6
00:00:23.159 --> 00:00:24.180
Terrell caught up to her.

7
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.042
"Are you going to find the Tattle Twins?"

8
00:00:29.403 --> 00:00:29.903
he asked.

9
00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:31.624
Roxy shook her head.

10
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.362
"There's an emergency at Police Headquarters.

11
00:00:34.722 --> 00:00:38.125
I'll be back soon."

12
00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:40.867
Terrell went back to his seat.

13
00:00:40.887 --> 00:00:43.890
"Rocket Girl was framed," he said.

14
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.591
Mara and Jack nodded.

15
00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:47.933
Terrell tapped his chin.

16
00:00:47.953 --> 00:00:50.836
"Rocket Girl always helps other people.

17
00:00:51.716 --> 00:00:52.857
I wish we could help her."

18
00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.581
Roxy arrived at Police Headquarters.

19
00:00:58.902 --> 00:01:00.704
Several police officers were waiting for her.

20
00:01:03.824 --> 00:01:04.985
"Where's the emergency?"

21
00:01:05.205 --> 00:01:05.905
Roxy asked.

22
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.647
An officer slapped handcuffs on Roxy.

23
00:01:09.387 --> 00:01:11.408
"You're under arrest, Rocket Girl."

24
00:01:11.428 --> 00:01:15.470
"What?" Roxy cried.

25
00:01:17.392 --> 00:01:19.653
The officer led Roxy toward the jail cells.

26
00:01:20.393 --> 00:01:21.974
Roxy looked down at the handcuffs.

27
00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:25.136
"I could break these and escape," she thought.

28
00:01:25.796 --> 00:01:27.477
She looked back at all the police officers.

29
00:01:27.497 --> 00:01:29.938
"But I don't want anyone to get hurt."

30
00:01:30.919 --> 00:01:32.400
The officer opened a jail cell.

31
00:01:33.184 --> 00:01:34.885
Detective Smith was sitting inside.

32
00:01:35.425 --> 00:01:36.225
He looked annoyed.

33
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:38.406
Roxy went in.

34
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.626
The officer took off the handcuffs.

35
00:01:41.486 --> 00:01:43.007
Then she slammed the door shut.

36
00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:48.508
Roxy said.

37
00:01:48.528 --> 00:01:50.389
"I don't like your new office."

38
00:01:51.169 --> 00:01:52.670
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

39
00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:55.750
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

40
00:01:56.351 --> 00:01:57.211
Roxy sighed.

41
00:01:57.231 --> 00:02:00.632
"Mayor Bloom tricked me into coming here.

42
00:02:01.664 --> 00:02:04.245
He obviously thinks we blew up that car.

43
00:02:04.785 --> 00:02:05.585
But we didn't.

44
00:02:06.105 --> 00:02:08.626
Remember?" Detective Smith nodded.

45
00:02:08.646 --> 00:02:10.106
"I remember.

46
00:02:10.426 --> 00:02:11.567
It was just last week.

47
00:02:12.627 --> 00:02:15.028
Two cars crashed, and one caught on fire.

48
00:02:15.928 --> 00:02:17.889
You put the fire out with your super breath.

49
00:02:18.809 --> 00:02:20.169
You also saved the driver."

50
00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:23.630
Roxy groaned.

51
00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:27.131
"What are we going to do, Detective?

52
00:02:27.671 --> 00:02:29.972
We have to prove that we're innocent."

53
00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.041
Just then they heard someone talking.

54
00:02:32.061 --> 00:02:35.322
"We need to send police to 100 West Street," an officer said.

55
00:02:35.342 --> 00:02:37.443
"Some Cooltubers are in trouble.

56
00:02:37.903 --> 00:02:39.023
They're called the Tattle Twins."

57
00:02:40.144 --> 00:02:41.725
"Okay," another officer said.

58
00:02:41.745 --> 00:02:44.065
"Hmm," Roxy said.

59
00:02:44.085 --> 00:02:45.766
"I wonder what's wrong."

60
00:02:46.626 --> 00:02:47.827
Suddenly she had an idea.

61
00:02:47.847 --> 00:02:51.889
"I should go and help the Tattle Twins, Detective.

62
00:02:52.869 --> 00:02:54.970
Then I can find out why they're framing me."

63
00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.891
"And me!"

64
00:02:57.191 --> 00:02:58.171
Detective Smith said.

65
00:02:58.191 --> 00:02:59.912
"Right," Roxy said.

66
00:03:02.388 --> 00:03:04.069
"Is it okay if I break out of here?"

67
00:03:05.109 --> 00:03:06.150
Detective Smith nodded.

68
00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.790
"Good luck, Rocket Girl."

69
00:03:08.671 --> 00:03:11.732
Boom! Roxy pounded through the wall and flew off.

70
00:03:13.053 --> 00:03:14.714
A police car zoomed toward West Street.

71
00:03:15.474 --> 00:03:16.834
Roxy shot past the car.

72
00:03:17.735 --> 00:03:19.956
A moment later she burst into an apartment.

73
00:03:21.336 --> 00:03:23.277
The Tattle Twins stood in front of a safe.

74
00:03:24.438 --> 00:03:26.619
"Yay!" Pam said.

75
00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:28.960
"Rocket Girl is here!"
